      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "うちの村が、近くに住む盗賊たちから\n頻繁に襲撃をうけて困っているんです！\n追い払ってくれたら、お礼を差し上げます。\nどなたか……どうか私たちの村を救ってください！",
        "official_en": "Our village is constantly raided by thieves. If this\ncontinues... I'm at my wit's end! This can't go on!\nWe have reward money if you can drive them\naway. Please! Save our village!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
